<title>LATVIA: RIGAS KOMMERCBANKA H1 PROFIT 915,000 LATS.</title>
<headline>RIGAS KOMMERCBANKA H1 PROFIT 915,000 LATS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1997</p>
<p>				  (million lats unless stated)</p>
<p> Net profit		   915,300 lats     vs 256,000 lats</p>
<p> Net interest/commission     5.72	    vs 9.29</p>
<p> Loss forex, security     131,100 lats     vs gain 479,000 lats</p>
<p> Other income		 357,500 lats     vs 176,000 lats</p>
<p> Total operating income	5.95	    vs 9.95</p>
<p> Administrative expenses     2.91	    vs 5.11</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	     969,800 lats     vs 351,000 lats</p>
<p> Assets			  129.67	    vs 97.71</p>
<p> Claims on credit institutions 12.00	 vs 7.51</p>
<p> Deposits			106.95	    vs 82.52</p>
<p>NOTE - Rigas kommerbanka is Latvia's third-largest bank but</p>
<p>is not quoted on the stock exchange. All comparisons are with</p>
<p>the end of 1996.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
